{"type":"text","timestamp":"2026-09-26T15:00:37.823Z","data":{"text":"Task complete. Summary of what I did:\n\n**Implementation** (`src/core/foundation/config-opencode.ts`, new):\n- `OPENCODE_TESTED_RANGE = '>=2.0.0 <3.0.0'`\n- `assessOpencodeVersion(raw)` extracts the first `major.minor.patch` (so `opencode v2.0.18` → `2.0.18`), returns `ok: false` only below 2.0.0, and `tested: true` only inside the range.\n- `diagnoseOpencode(context)` returns a `harness-version` diagnosis with the exact spec messages: pass inside range, fail below 2.0.0, warning at/above 3.0.0 or unparseable.\n\n**Catalog** (`src/core/foundation/harness-catalog.ts`): imported `diagnoseOpencode` and set `diagnose: diagnoseOpencode` on the opencode entry.\n\n**Tests** (`tests/opencode-doctor.test.ts`, new): drives `runDoctorChecks` with a fake opencode binary (`opencode.bin`) for v2 (pass/quiet), v1 (fail → doctor exits 1), v3 (pass/warn), unparseable (pass/warn), plus asserts the catalog hook identity.\n\n**Verification**: task `verify` passed (5/5) and the proposal's `pnpm verify` passed (typechecks, build, full suite, lint). Wrote `openspec/changes/092-opencode-v2-adapter/.run/results/1.md` with `## Changed` and the `Touched:` line."}}
